00:01:55,220 --> 00:02:01,830
unknown except the key key B in sector four.

27
00:02:01,850 --> 00:02:07,850
So key B in sector four is known and all the other keys are unknown.

28
00:02:07,880 --> 00:02:14,450
So now what we are going to do is we are going to perform the same nested attack on this card as well

29
00:02:14,450 --> 00:02:19,280
