33
00:02:32,980 --> 00:02:38,770
And then what we have to do is we have to type T to transfer.

34
00:02:40,320 --> 00:02:41,250
All data.

35
00:02:42,330 --> 00:02:44,010
Into our emulator memory.

36
00:02:44,920 --> 00:02:46,200
Let's just hit Enter.

37
00:02:52,410 --> 00:02:57,330
And over here you can see it has start finding the valid keys.

38
