So it might take a few minutes or a few seconds to find all the keys.

39
00:03:19,390 --> 00:03:19,690
Okay.

40
00:03:19,690 --> 00:03:24,970
So as you can see, it's taking some time, but it's finding the valid keys.

41
00:03:26,070 --> 00:03:29,310
All right, so all the valid keys are found.

42
00:03:29,970 --> 00:03:32,400
Just by using this one default key.

43
00:03:32,750 --> 00:03:33,010
Right.

44
00:03:33,030 --> 00:03:41,040
So you can see all the key A's and key B's are also available now just by using this one default key.

45
00:03:41,070 --> 00:03:49,620
So if by mistake, you have kept only one key, whether it's Key A or key B in the card in a default

46
