53
00:04:15,540 --> 00:04:20,370
Just by using this one default key, we were able to find all the other keys.

54
00:04:21,240 --> 00:04:28,410
So the point of this exercise was to show you that you should modify all the sector trailers, whether

55
00:04:28,410 --> 00:04:30,820
